Name:           MultiMC5
Version:        @VERSION@
# one package for every rpm distribution: no distribution tag in its name
Release:        1
Summary:        A local install wrapper for MultiMC

License:        ASL 2.0
URL:            https://multimc.org
Source0:        https://files.multimc.org/downloads/multimc-wrapper-%{version}.tar.gz
# A script and data files: nothing to build, nothing architecture-specific, no debug info
BuildArch:      noarch
%global debug_package %{nil}

BuildRequires:  make
Requires:       zenity wget xrandr hicolor-icon-theme qt5-qtbase qt5-qtbase-gui qt5-qtsvg
Provides:       multimc MultiMC multimc5

%description
A local install wrapper for MultiMC

%prep
%autosetup -n multimc-wrapper-%{version}

%build

%install
# what goes where is the Makefile's
make install DESTDIR=%{buildroot}

%files
%dir /opt/multimc
/opt/multimc/icon.svg
/opt/multimc/run.sh
%{_bindir}/multimc
%{_datadir}/applications/org.multimc.MultiMC.desktop
%{_datadir}/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/org.multimc.MultiMC.svg
%{_datadir}/metainfo/org.multimc.MultiMC.metainfo.xml
%{_mandir}/man1/multimc.1*

%changelog
* Sun Nov 15 2026 Petr Mrázek <peterix@gmail.com> - 1.9-1
- Desktop file and metainfo named org.multimc.MultiMC, as the Launcher's Wayland app id, with
  StartupWMClass=MultiMC for X11, and the icon in the hicolor theme: the window gets its icon
- Built from the wrapper's source tarball with its Makefile, like the deb and Arch packages
- /usr/bin/multimc runs the wrapper

* Sun Nov 15 2026 Petr Mrázek <peterix@gmail.com> - 1.8-1
- First start downloads the new updater's Stable package (MultiMC-linux-*-qt5.tar.gz)

* Mon Nov 09 2026 Petr Mrázek <peterix@gmail.com> - 1.7-1
- The Launcher links Qt SVG and needs Qt GUI: depend on qt5-qtsvg and qt5-qtbase-gui
- noarch, without a debug package (current rpmbuild refused to build it)

* Sun Oct 03 2021 imperatorstorm <30777770+ImperatorStorm@users.noreply.github.com>
- added manpage

* Tue Jun 01 2021 kb1000 <fedora@kb1000.de> - 1.4-2
- Add xrandr to the dependencies

* Tue Dec 08 00:34:35 CET 2020 joshua-stone <joshua.gage.stone@gmail.com>
- Add metainfo.xml for improving package metadata

* Wed Nov 25 22:53:59 CET 2020 kb1000 <fedora@kb1000.de>
- Initial version of the RPM package, based on the Ubuntu package
